# Scenario: M8.2's movie behaviour (docs/FFMPEG_MIGRATION_PLAN.md section 5): the attract demo (a movie with sound)
# closed at varied moments, and the game quit during a movie. A fresh save root. Each cycle: the title (its movie,
# 32 s with no input), the demo's movie opened, then START after 1 to 110 s -- the game closes the movie and its
# sound and goes back to the title, whose movie opens again. Eleven cycles; then, during the next demo, the game
# asked to exit as closing its window asks it (its own shutdown: the movie's thread, sound and files released).
# With DOTHEROES_NATIVE_MOVIE=1 the native player answers (a lift with config/m8_native_movie.json); without it,
# Bink. Checked afterwards from the logs: every open closed, no movie left at the exit, the run's memory. The
# wait matches the demo's open only (Bink's file open, the native player's "opened"), not its close line.
#! env DOTHEROES_DEV_KEYS=1 PS3_VERBOSE=0 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log
#! env WINDOW=1 VISIBLE=1 GRAB_EVERY=10 PS3_OSD_FPS=2 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0
#! secs 1500
log TitleMovie 120
segment skips eleven demos closed at varied moments
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 1
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 3
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 7
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 13
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 20
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 31
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 45
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 60
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 77
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 95
press START
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 110
press START
endseg
log (?m)PlayDemoMovieUS\.bik(\sopened|$) 90
sleep 30
quit
sleep 20
